  causeName: Myvi
  headline: "Mangsa Kena Langgar Myvi\nDi Lorong Sempit"
  headlineEN: Victim struck by Myvi in a narrow lane
  subhead: '"Semua orang tahu Myvi bawak laju. Tapi dia tetap tak elak."'
  subheadEN: '"Everyone knows Myvis drive fast. He still didn''t dodge."'
  flavourText: "Allahyarham dikenali gemar makan nasi lemak pagi.\nSemoga rohnya tenang di jalan yang lebih selamat."
